{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1679928915_2077112_a70ea39606e099d92b3ff0fdcd012590Dear Bump August 2022-043 copy.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans Pro Cyr', 'Iowan Old Style', 'Apple Garamond', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', 'Droid Serif', Times, 'Source Serif Pro', serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Indulging yourself with an occasional gift is one of the best ways to look after yourself during pregnancy, too. Mailed to your home monthly, Dearbump pregnancy subscription boxes are full of everything a mum-to-be needs. From nourishing skincare and tasty treats to uplifting reads, the boxes are full of goodies that will make your day and chase your worries away.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans Pro Cyr', 'Iowan Old Style', 'Apple Garamond', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', 'Droid Serif', Times, 'Source Serif Pro', serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">We&rsquo;ve designed each Dearbump subscription box with every stage of pregnancy in mind. Every month, you&rsquo;ll receive top-quality luxury products that will pamper you and help prep you for the next stage of your beautiful journey. Every box is something to look forward to.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans Pro Cyr', 'Iowan Old Style', 'Apple Garamond', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', 'Droid Serif', Times, 'Source Serif Pro', serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">When you sign up, you can tell us&nbsp;your stage of pregnancy. Feel free to also share with us your due date. That way, we can plan the subscription boxes better and ensure suitable goodies arrive at your doorstep each month.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans Pro Cyr', 'Iowan Old Style', 'Apple Garamond', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', 'Droid Serif', Times, 'Source Serif Pro', serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Not a mum-to-be, but someone dear to you is expecting? Send your love to her through Dearbump&rsquo;s pregnancy subscription boxes. With this gift idea, you can make sure each box contains pampering pregnancy-safe products that can lift her mood and brighten up her day.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans Pro Cyr', 'Iowan Old Style', 'Apple Garamond', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', 'Droid Serif', Times, 'Source Serif Pro', serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Whether you&rsquo;re a soon-to-be-mum or someone looking for a great gift for an expectant mum, you can count on our subscription boxes to deliver a boost of happiness. Sign up today.</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: 'Harmonia Sans Pro Cyr', 'Iowan Old Style', 'Apple Garamond', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', 'Droid Serif', Times, 'Source Serif Pro', serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol'; font-size: 16.8px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</div>",
